{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫劇《璀璨之城》昨晚（13日）第2集講述，香港檢控官洪海允Alice（高海寧飾）介入調查尚利鋒涉嫌商業罪案，傳召官家三父子官志琛（姜大衞飾）、官孝賢（張智霖飾）及官孝君（吳卓羲飾）問話。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:39.742140+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T07:40:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416480+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:40:37.416480+00:00","content_hash":"e1029202f3d6a3ef174257feca2af7bce87dbf99ba9db15671ea3508d1d6b875","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}